  "findings": [
    "ROOT actually viewed all four LIVE whole-frame contact sheets (12 source plus20retained day/night exports) and the original mobile failed-parent fallback PNG. No staged image substitutes for live evidence.",
    "Corrected Sung camera shows its original roof, facade and body on both devices; the previous V3 mobile image was obstructed and is not accepted.",
    "Original podium stepped platforms/roofs appear around the retained/new towers. Partial occlusion by the surrounding assembly remains; no claim of complete unobstructed surfaces.",
    "Retained low roofs 234593 and 110480 are visible from elevated views; desktop110480 retains partial occlusion by its surrounding towers. Retained tall originals remain visible.",
    "New sources retain their original untextured dark night appearance with proceduralWindows false; neighbouring legacy lit facades remain.",
    "When the podium download is intentionally denied, Nam basic fallback is visibly present with selected outline. Final day/night retained views show recovered original Nam."
